  "verseCount": 13,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "36",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NUM 36"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "36",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Oke ụmụ ndị inyom Zelofehad",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nʼoge ahụ, ndịisi ezi agbụrụ Gilead, nwa Makia, nwa Manase, otu nʼime ụmụ Josef, bịakwutere Mosis na ndị ndu, na ndịisi ezi ụmụ Izrel sị ha:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Mgbe",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.36.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.36.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nyere unu onyenwe m iwu inye ụmụ Izrel ala ahụ nʼihe nketa site nʼife nza, onye nyekwara gị iwu iwere ihe nketa nwanne anyị nwoke Zelofehad nyefee nʼaka ụmụ ya ndị inyom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ugbu a, ọ bụrụ na ha alụọ ndị ikom Izrel si nʼebo ọzọ, mgbe ahụ, ihe nketa ha ga-abụ nke anapụrụ anyị, tụkwasị nʼihe nketa nke ebo ebe ha lụrụ di. Nʼụzọ dị otu a, ihe nketa anyị ga-abụ nke e wepụrụ ihe site na ya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mgbe afọ inwere onwe nye Izrel ruru, a ga-agụnye ihe nketa ha nʼebo ebe ha lụrụ dị. A ga-esi otu a wepụ ala ha site nʼihe nketa nke nna nna anyị ha ketara.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mgbe ahụ, Mosis nyere ndị Izrel ntụziaka site nʼiwu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.36.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.36.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sị, \"Ihe ndị ikom ebo Josef na-ekwu ziri ezi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma nke a bụ iwu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.36.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.36.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na-enye maka ụmụ ndị inyom Zelofehad. Ha nwere ike ịlụ onye ọbụla masịrị ha, ma onye ha ga-alụ ga-abụrịrị onye si nʼagbụrụ ebo nna ha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O nweghị ihe nketa ọbụla nʼIzrel ga-esi nʼaka otu ebo gafee nʼebo ọzọ. Nʼihi na ihe nketa nke ebo ọbụla ga-adịgidere ha dịka otu e siri kee ya nye nna nna ha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nwa nwanyị Izrel ọbụla ketara ala nʼebo Izrel ọ bụla ga-alụ di site nʼagbụrụ ebo nna ya. Ka ala ha ghara ịgafere ebo ọzọ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ọ dịghị ihe nketa ọbụla ga-esi nʼotu ebo feere ebo ọzọ. Nʼihi na ebo Izrel ọbụla ga-edebere onwe ha ala ha ketara.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ya mere, ụmụ ndị inyom Zelofehad mere dịka",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.36.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.36.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nyere Mosis nʼiwu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ụmụ Zelofehad ndị a: Mahla, na Tịaza, na Hogla, na Milka, na Noa, lụrụ ndị ikom si nʼebo nna ha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha lụrụ di nʼagbụrụ ụmụ Manase, nwa Josef. Nʼụzọ dị otu a, ihe nketa ha dịgidere nʼebo na agbụrụ nna ha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndị a bụ iwu na ụkpụrụ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.36.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.36.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sitere nʼaka Mosis nye ndị Izrel nʼoge ha nọ nʼobosara ala Moab, nʼakụkụ osimiri Jọdan, na ncherita ihu Jeriko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
